{"seq":1,"slug":"data-quality-engineering","title":"数据质量工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/governance-and-operations/data-quality-engineering","wordCount":1649,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据质量工程\">数据质量工程</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>数据质量工程是构建可信数据平台的核心保障体系。当数据消费者对数据的信任度下降时，他们会回归直觉决策，数据平台的投资就失去了意义。数据质量工程的目标是建立从预防、检测到修复的完整闭环，在质量问题影响下游之前拦截并修复。</p>\n<p>与传统的手工数据审核不同，现代数据质量工程强调自动化、可编程和持续监控。它借鉴了软件工程中测试和 CI/CD 的理念，将数据质量检查嵌入数据管道的每个环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据质量工程把软件工程中「测试 + CI/CD」的理念移植到数据管道，其核心是三个相互衔接的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质量维度可量化</strong>：完整性、准确性、一致性、时效性、唯一性、有效性六个维度，每个都必须有可计算的指标（如 NULL 比例、与权威源对比的偏差），而非主观感受</li>\n<li><strong>检查前移（Shift Left）</strong>：与其在最终产出后发现问题，不如在管道最上游检测——越早拦截，脏数据的传播范围越小、修复成本越低</li>\n<li><strong>契约即执行</strong>：数据契约不能只是文档，必须通过准入检查、持续监控、变更管控和违约告警被自动化执行，否则会在源系统变更时迅速失效</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三者共同构成从预防、检测到修复的完整闭环：质量目标由维度定义，检测能力由分层防御提供，而契约保证生产者与消费者之间的承诺不被单方面打破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据质量维度\">数据质量维度</h2><h3 id=\"六大核心维度\">六大核心维度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>度量方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整性（Completeness）</td>\n<td>必填字段是否都有值</td>\n<td>NULL 比例、缺失记录占比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确性（Accuracy）</td>\n<td>数据是否反映真实世界</td>\n<td>与权威数据源对比、规则校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性（Consistency）</td>\n<td>跨系统的数据是否一致</td>\n<td>字段间逻辑关系校验、跨表对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效性（Timeliness）</td>\n<td>数据是否在预期时间到达</td>\n<td>数据新鲜度监控、SLA 达成率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>唯一性（Uniqueness）</td>\n<td>是否存在重复记录</td>\n<td>主键唯一性检查、去重比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效性（Validity）</td>\n<td>数据是否符合定义的格式和范围</td>\n<td>Schema 校验、值域检查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"质量指标量化\">质量指标量化</h3><p>每个维度应该有可量化的指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 完整性检查示例&#10;SELECT&#10;  COUNT(*) AS total_rows,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN user_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_user_id,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN email IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_email,&#10;  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN user_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 100.0 / COUNT(*), 2)&#10;    AS null_user_id_pct&#10;FROM staging.users&#10;WHERE load_date = CURRENT_DATE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 完整性检查示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_rows,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> null_user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> null_email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> null_user_id_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> staging</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"数据质量检查框架\">数据质量检查框架</h2><h3 id=\"dbt-tests\">dbt Tests</h3><p>dbt 内建了四种通用测试，并支持自定义测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# schema.yml - dbt 数据测试定义&#10;models:&#10;  - name: orders&#10;    columns:&#10;      - name: order_id&#10;        tests:&#10;          - unique # 唯一性&#10;          - not_null # 非空&#10;      - name: amount&#10;        tests:&#10;          - not_null&#10;          - dbt_utils.accepted_range:&#10;              min_value: 0&#10;              max_value: 1000000&#10;      - name: status&#10;        tests:&#10;          - accepted_values:&#10;              values: [&#39;pending&#39;, &#39;completed&#39;, &#39;cancelled&#39;, &#39;refunded&#39;]&#10;    tests:&#10;      - dbt_utils.expression_is_true:&#10;          expression: &#39;completed_at &gt;= created_at&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># schema.yml - dbt 数据测试定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">models</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unique</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 唯一性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">not_null</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 非空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">not_null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dbt_utils.accepted_range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              min_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              max_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">accepted_values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refunded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dbt_utils.expression_is_true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed_at >= created_at'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"great-expectations\">Great Expectations</h3><p>Great Expectations（GX）是最流行的开源数据质量框架，提供丰富的期望库（Expectations）和数据验证工作流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import great_expectations as gx&#10;&#10;context = gx.get_context()&#10;&#10;# 定义期望套件&#10;suite = context.add_expectation_suite(&quot;orders_validation&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 添加期望&#10;suite.add_expectation(&#10;    gx.expectations.ExpectColumnValuesToNotBeNull(column=&quot;order_id&quot;)&#10;)&#10;suite.add_expectation(&#10;    gx.expectations.ExpectColumnValuesToBeBetween(&#10;        column=&quot;amount&quot;, min_value=0, max_value=1000000&#10;    )&#10;)&#10;suite.add_expectation(&#10;    gx.expectations.ExpectTableRowCountToBeBetween(&#10;        min_value=10000, max_value=10000000&#10;    )&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 执行验证&#10;result = context.run_checkpoint(checkpoint_name=&quot;orders_checkpoint&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> great_expectations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gx.get_context()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 定义期望套件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">suite </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.add_expectation_suite(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders_validation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加期望</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">suite.add_expectation(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gx.expectations.ExpectColumnValuesToNotBeNull(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">column</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#242