e\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">duplicate_count(order_id) = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">avg(amount) between 50 and 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">freshness(created_at) &#x3C; 2h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      fail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        when required column missing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        when wrong type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">varchar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">decimal</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"数据契约-data-contracts\">数据契约（Data Contracts）</h2><p>数据契约是源系统（生产者）与数据平台（消费者）之间的明确协议，定义了数据的格式、语义和质量保证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"契约内容\">契约内容</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# data-contract.yaml&#10;apiVersion: datacontract/v1&#10;kind: DataContract&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: user-events&#10;  version: 2.1.0&#10;  owner: user-platform-team&#10;  domain: user-engagement&#10;&#10;schema:&#10;  type: object&#10;  properties:&#10;    event_id:&#10;      type: string&#10;      format: uuid&#10;      description: 全局唯一事件标识符&#10;    user_id:&#10;      type: string&#10;      pattern: &#39;^U[0-9]{10}$&#39;&#10;    event_type:&#10;      type: string&#10;      enum: [page_view, click, purchase, search]&#10;    timestamp:&#10;      type: string&#10;      format: date-time&#10;&#10;quality:&#10;  freshness: &#39;&lt; 5 minutes&#39;&#10;  completeness:&#10;    event_id: 100%&#10;    user_id: &#39;&gt;= 99.9%&#39;&#10;  volume:&#10;    daily_min: 1000000&#10;    daily_max: 50000000&#10;&#10;sla:&#10;  availability: 99.95%&#10;  support: &#39;#data-quality-alerts&#39;&#10;&#10;evolution:&#10;  breaking_changes: &#39;require 2-week notice&#39;&#10;  additive_changes: &#39;notify consumers within 24h&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># data-contract.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">datacontract/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span sty